---
import Abstract from "../assets/icons/abstract-shape.png";
import "../assets/styles/carousels.css"
---

<main class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <svg
    class="liquid-background absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-[-1] pointer-events-none md:w-[300%] md:left-[-100%]"
    viewBox="0 0 1440 800"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    preserveAspectRatio="none"
  >
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="liquidGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
        <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#B3CFE5;stop-opacity:0.3"></stop>
        <stop offset="50%" style="stop-color:#4A7FA7;stop-opacity:0.2"></stop>
        <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#B3CFE5;stop-opacity:0.3"></stop>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path
      d="M0,192L48,197.3C96,203,192,213,288,229.3C384,245,480,267,576,250.7C672,235,768,181,864,181.3C960,181,1056,235,1152,234.7C1248,235,1344,181,1392,154.7L1440,128L1440,0L1392,0C1344,0,1248,0,1152,0C1056,0,960,0,864,0C768,0,672,0,576,0C480,0,384,0,288,0C192,0,96,0,48,0L0,0Z"
      fill="url(#liquidGradient)"></path>
    <path
      d="M0,384L48,394.7C96,405,192,427,288,416C384,405,480,363,576,330.7C672,299,768,277,864,282.7C960,288,1056,320,1152,330.7C1248,341,1344,331,1392,325.3L1440,320L1440,800L1392,800C1344,800,1248,800,1152,800C1056,800,960,800,864,800C768,800,672,800,576,800C480,800,384,800,288,800C192,800,96,800,48,800L0,800Z"
      fill="url(#liquidGradient)"
      opacity="0.5"></path>
  </svg>

  <div class="parents relative z-10 flex flex-col md:px-20 px-10">
    <div class="child w-full flex flex-col items-center gap-4 glass-card">
      <h2 class="header text-xl6">About Us</h2>
      <p>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Aliquam
        facilis, eius perferendis odio, iste laboriosam inventore provident
        consequuntur praesentium, quidem excepturi repellat. Quidem molestiae
        eum neque, sunt quo nesciunt voluptas minima minus quam, tenetur error,
        amet saepe praesentium numquam! Corporis quia maiores asperiores ipsum
        dicta eius unde, nihil numquam voluptatibus!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 cards-container">
      <div class="list flex flex-col gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          class="mb-4"
          src={Abstract.src}
          width="30"
          height="30"
          alt="Abstract"
        />
        <span>Lorem Ipsum</span>
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Libero fugiat
          voluptatum quisquam reprehenderit provident, nostrum numquam placeat
          nesciunt saepe nulla!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="list flex flex-col gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          class="mb-4"
          src={Abstract.src}
          width="30"
          height="30"
          alt="Abstract"
        />
        <span>Lorem Ipsum</span>
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Libero fugiat
          voluptatum quisquam reprehenderit provident, nostrum numquam placeat
          nesciunt saepe nulla!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="list flex flex-col gap-2 items-center">
        <img
          class="mb-4"
          src={Abstract.src}
          width="30"
          height="30"
          alt="Abstract"
        />
